0
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Schedules
// When the Castle Deep event starts. How long it lasts is set by CastleDeepEventTime in the Event settings.
//   Year: The year it starts. A wildcard means every year.
//   Month: The month it starts, 1 to 12. A wildcard means every month.
//   Day: The day of the month it starts, 1 to 31. A wildcard means every day.
//   Day of the week: -1 Every day | 1 Sunday | 2 Monday | 3 Tuesday | 4 Wednesday | 5 Thursday | 6 Friday | 7 Saturday
//   Hour: The hour it starts, 0 to 23. A wildcard means every hour.
//   Minute: The minute it starts, 0 to 59. A wildcard means every minute.
//   Second: The second it starts, 0 to 59.
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [Number]    [*/0~12]    [*/0~31]    [*/1~7]      [*/0~23]    [*/0~59]    [*/0~59]
//  Year        Month       Day         DayOfWeek    Hour        Minute      Second
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    *           *           *           *            4           0           0
    *           *           *           *            12          0           0
    *           *           *           *            20          0           0
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Spawn Groups
// The chance of each group.
//   Group: The group of monsters. When the event starts one group is picked.
//   Spawn rate (%): Chance of choosing this group. The groups are tried in order; if none is chosen the draw is repeated, so the real chance is higher than the number.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~10]    [0~100]
//  Group     SpawnRate
//----------------------------------------------------------
    1         50
    2         50
end

2
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Stages
// When each stage of a group starts.
//   Group: The group this stage belongs to.
//   Stage: The stage: 1 to 3.
//   Starts after (minutes): Minutes after the event starts when this stage spawns its monsters.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~10]    [1~3]    [Number]
//  Group     Stage    StageTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
    1         1        0
    1         2        10
    1         3        20
    2         1        0
    2         2        10
    2         3        20
end

3
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Monsters
// The monsters of each stage and where they appear.
//   Group: The group this monster belongs to.
//   Stage: The stage in which it spawns.
//   Monster: The monster that spawns.
//   Most monsters: How many of this monster spawn.
//   From X: Left edge of the area (in the Castle Siege map) where they spawn.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area (in the Castle Siege map) where they spawn.
//   To X: Right edge of the area (in the Castle Siege map) where they spawn.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area (in the Castle Siege map) where they spawn.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~10]    [1~3]    [Number]    [1~1000]         [1~255]    [1~255]    [1~255]    [1~255]
//  Group     Stage    Monster     MaxSpawnCount    X          Y          X2         Y2
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
